    <h2>Financing options</h2>
    <p>Major dental work — especially implants and full-arch reconstruction — is often a significant investment. We offer several financing options so cost doesn't have to be the thing that decides your care.</p>

    <div class="financing-grid">
      <div class="financing-card"><strong>Cherry</strong></div>
